WEBVTT

00:03:59.616 --> 00:04:01.265
Wuxuu dhihi jiray--

00:04:01.265 --> 00:04:03.352
HP: Niyadaada faaruji.

00:04:03.352 --> 00:04:04.416
(Qosol)

00:04:04.416 --> 00:04:10.429
Ahaaw Hanaan-laawe iyo Qaab-laawe, sidii biyaha.

00:04:10.429 --> 00:04:12.419
Biyo ayaa koop ku shubeesa.

00:04:12.419 --> 00:04:15.315
waxay noqoneesa koop.

00:04:15.315 --> 00:04:18.422
Biyo ayaa dhalo ku shubeesa, waxany noqoneesa dhalada.

00:04:18.422 --> 00:04:21.801
Kirli ku shub, weli kirli uunbeey noqoneysa.

00:04:21.801 --> 00:04:24.450
Biyaha weey qulqulayaan hada

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:27.100
ama weey burburi karaan.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.455
Biyo noqo saaxib. (Sacbis)